sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client / Dashboard
    participant API as eval-hub API<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant DB as PostgreSQL / SQLite<br/>SQL Storage
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Init as eval-runtime-init<br/>Init Container
    participant S3 as S3 Storage<br/>HTTPS
    participant Sidecar as eval-runtime-sidecar<br/>Reverse Proxy
    participant Adapter as Evaluation Adapter<br/>Primary Container
    participant Model as Model Endpoint<br/>Configurable TLS
    participant MLflow as MLflow Tracking<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    participant OCI as OCI Registry

    Note over Client,OCI: Evaluation Job Lifecycle

    Client->>API: POST /api/v1/evaluations/jobs<br/>Headers: X-User, X-Tenant
    API->>API: Validate identity headers<br/>(cluster mode enforcement)
    API->>DB: Persist job state<br/>INSERT evaluation job
    DB-->>API: Job ID

    API->>K8s: Create ConfigMap<br/>(evaluation configuration)
    API->>K8s: Create Secret<br/>(credential references)
    API->>K8s: Read HardwareProfile CR<br/>(hardware requirements)
    API->>K8s: Create Job<br/>(init + sidecar + adapter)
    K8s-->>API: Job created

    Note over Init,S3: Init Phase - Test Data Download

    Init->>S3: Download test data<br/>AWS SDK v2
    S3-->>Init: Test data artifacts
    Init-->>Adapter: Test data available<br/>(shared volume)

    Note over Adapter,Model: Evaluation Execution

    Adapter->>Sidecar: Inference request<br/>(placeholder API key)
    Sidecar->>Sidecar: Resolve credentials<br/>from mounted K8s Secret
    Sidecar->>Model: Forward request<br/>with real API key injected
    Model-->>Sidecar: Inference response
    Sidecar-->>Adapter: Proxied response

    Note over Adapter,OCI: Result Export

    Adapter->>Sidecar: Evaluation results
    Sidecar->>API: POST results<br/>(configurable TLS + custom CA)
    API->>DB: Update job state<br/>evaluation results
    API->>MLflow: Export results<br/>experiment tracking<br/>(configurable TLS + custom CA)
    API->>OCI: Publish evalcards<br/>(optional)

    Note over API,API: Observability

    API->>API: Prometheus metrics<br/>on dedicated MetricsServer port
    API-->>API: OTLP/gRPC export<br/>traces, metrics, logs
